{
  "id": "lucia_start",
  "start": [
    { "node": "question_menu", "when": { "flag": "lucia_talked", "equals": 1 } },
    { "node": "first_meeting" }
  ],
  "speakers": [
    { "id": "player", "name": "Banec", "role": "player",
      "portrait": "assets/ui/portraits/player.png" },
    { "id": "lucia", "name": "Lucia Redwyne", "role": "npc", "entity": "lucia",
      "portrait": "assets/ui/portraits/lucia.png" },
    { "id": "narrator", "name": "Narrator", "role": "narrator" }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "first_meeting", "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "There is little doubt that this busy-looking woman is the unchallenged mistress of the Redwyne household. As she spots you, a look of resignation flashes across her face.",
      "next": "young_people"
    },
    {
      "id": "young_people", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "You young people never learn to keep out of my kitchen, do you?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Sorry madam, I did not mean to trespass, but I need to talk to you.",
          "actions": [
            { "op": "set", "flag": "lucia_talked", "value": 1 },
            { "op": "set", "flag": "complain_about_wastesedge", "value": 1 }
          ],
          "next": "too_busy"
        },
        {
          "text": "Calm down, please. This is important. I'm investigating the theft.",
          "actions": [
            { "op": "set", "flag": "lucia_talked", "value": 1 },
            { "op": "set", "flag": "complain_about_wastesedge", "value": 1 }
          ],
          "next": "investigation"
        },
        {
          "text": "My apologies. Must have been the wrong door ...",
          "actions": [
            { "op": "set", "flag": "lucia_talked", "value": 1 },
            { "op": "set", "flag": "complain_about_wastesedge", "value": 1 }
          ],
          "next": "goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "too_busy", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "What questions? Don't you see I'm busy? Who's going to put the food on the table, if I'm going to chat with you? Now out of my sight with you!",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "Lunch can wait, but if you don't help with my investigation, the thief might get away!", "next": "investigation" },
        { "text": "My apologies. Must have been the wrong door ...", "next": "goodbye" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "investigation", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "You are looking for the thief!? My apologies then, sir. It is about time that somebody takes an interest into this unlucky incident.",
      "next": "question_menu"
    },
    {
      "id": "question_menu", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "Now don't keep me off my work. Ask what you want to know and then out with you!",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I need to fetch something for my mistress, but the pantry is locked.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              { "flag": "get_item", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "pantry_locked", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "told_on_talan", "equals": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "lucia_refuses_key", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "lucia_angry_key"
        },
        {
          "text": "I need to fetch something for my mistress, but the pantry is locked.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              { "flag": "get_item", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "pantry_locked", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "told_on_talan", "equals": 0 }
            ]
          },
          "next": "lucia_heard_silverhair"
        },
        {
          "text": "Look, Lucia, I spoke with Talan and he understands what I had to do.",
          "when": {
            "all": [
              { "flag": "get_item", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "pantry_locked", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "lucia_refuses_key", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "soothe_lucia", "equals": 1 },
              { "flag": "told_on_talan", "equals": 2 }
            ]
          },
          "next": "lucia_talan_reconciled"
        },
        {
          "text": "I know that Rhayne Frostbloom heard a noise outside the inn during that night.",
          "when": { "flag": "know_noise", "equals": 2 },
          "next": "talan_practising"
        },
        {
          "text": "I was wondering whether you noticed anything unusual during the night of the theft.",
          "repeatable": true,
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "lucia_asked_about_theft", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "rooms_apart"
        },
        {
          "text": "You said Master Fingolson is a regular guest. What can you tell me about him?",
          "when": { "flag": "lucia_asked_about_theft", "equals": 1 },
          "repeatable": true,
          "next": "fingolson_regular"
        },
        {
          "text": "Well, you were very ... helpful, madam. But if you'll excuse me now, I've got a thief to catch.",
          "repeatable": true,
          "next": "goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_angry_key", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "... and now you want my key!? You have nerves! Do you think I'd forget how you let Talan down, despite the word you've given me?",
      "choices": [
        { "text": "Please Lucia, I need the key.", "next": "lucia_false_friendliness" },
        { "text": "And what about my mistress?", "next": "lucia_pities_silverhair" },
        { "text": "Just give me that key and I won't bother you again!", "next": "lucia_rejects_tone" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_false_friendliness", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "Spare me your false friendliness. You tricked me once with your charm, but a second time I won't fall for it!",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_pities_silverhair", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "I pity the poor woman; held for theft and stuck with a sycophant like you.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_rejects_tone", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "And I'm not taking that tone either! You have used my confidence and must suffer the consequences.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_talan_reconciled", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "He's not in terrible trouble then? Seems you are in luck, Banec. I wouldn't have forgiven you if you brought any harm upon the lad.",
      "next": "lucia_reconciled_key"
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_reconciled_key", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "May I have the key then?",
      "next": "lucia_reconciled_hands_key"
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_reconciled_hands_key", "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Without any further words, Lucia reaches into her apron and hands you the key to the storeroom.",
      "on_end": "grant_pantry_key", "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_heard_silverhair", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "Then you have spoken to your Lady? I was afraid that Jelom wouldn't allow you to see her. Even I was refused entry when I brought her some breakfast this morning! Can you imagine that?",
      "next": "player_reminds_key"
    },
    {
      "id": "player_reminds_key", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "The key, Mrs. Redwyne ...",
      "next": "lucia_remembers_key"
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_remembers_key", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "What? Ah ... the key. Sorry, Banec. I only hope it is not too uncomfortable for your mistress, being locked into that small chamber and all that.",
      "next": "lucia_hands_key"
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_hands_key", "speaker": "narrator",
      "text": "Lucia rambles on some more, but finally she reaches into her apron and hands you the key to the storeroom.",
      "on_end": "grant_pantry_key", "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "rooms_apart", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "Something unusual? How should I? We're sleeping under the roof, whereas poor Master Fingolson has his room downstairs, in the cellar. Just as his kind likes it the most.",
      "next": "ask_talan"
    },
    {
      "id": "ask_talan", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "But perhaps you should ask Talan, as he was on duty that night. If somebody noticed something, then it was him.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "fingolson_regular", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "He stays here quite often, and has done that for many years. I wouldn't say that I know him well, though. He behaves quite reserved and formal, but he is a pleasant character.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "talan_practising", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "Outside the inn you say? I don't know anything about this, but I suspect that was rather Talan practising than the thief.",
      "next": "what_practising"
    },
    {
      "id": "what_practising", "speaker": "player",
      "text": "Talan practising what?",
      "next": "lucia_confidence"
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_confidence", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "I shouldn't have mentioned this at all! Telling on other people is not right. But if it helps to clear your mistress' guilt, I cannot keep it secret. But you mustn't tell anybody, do you understand!?",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "You have my word, Lucia. Now what is it?",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_talan_singing", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "singing_reveal"
        },
        {
          "text": "I can't promise anything before I know what you are talking about.",
          "next": "lucia_refuses"
        },
        {
          "text": "Please Lucia. If it has anything to do with the theft, I need to know! Don't you want the real thief caught?",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_talan_singing", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "only_reason"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "lucia_refuses", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "I want no harm done to Talan, see. He is a good lad, and he deserves better than ending like Jelom. Don't destroy the chance to make something out of his life.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "Please Lucia. If it has anything to do with the theft, I need to know! Don't you want the real thief caught?",
          "actions": [{ "op": "set", "flag": "know_talan_singing", "value": 1 }],
          "next": "only_reason"
        },
        { "text": "I don't want anybody harm, but I will do what I must to find the thief.", "next": "goodbye" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "only_reason", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "And that is the only reason why I'll tell you about Talan. But you'd better not disappoint me!",
      "next": "singing_reveal"
    },
    {
      "id": "singing_reveal", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "He is singing. Talan sometimes leaves his post to practice his voice where nobody hears him. That's nothing bad, but he'd be more than embarrassed if you tell it around. And I fear Jelom won't take it very well.",
      "end": true
    },
    {
      "id": "goodbye", "speaker": "lucia",
      "text": "But enough chatting. This food won't prepare itself, and you still have a thief to catch.",
      "end": true
    }
  ]
}
